# The provin.oss revision these measurements are attributable to.
#
# A pin is a SHA, never a branch name. A benchmark run against a moving branch
# tip is not attributable to anything: the next run measures different code and
# nobody can say which change moved the number. A published figure without a pin
# is not a measurement, it is an anecdote.
#
# This SHA is the commit provin.oss's tag v0.4.0 names, the release merge on
# main; go.mod requires v0.4.0, and `make verify-pin` compares this SHA with
# the commit the module's origin record gives for that version.
#
# The figures Paper 04 published were measured at 4174829b7549 (the v0.3.0
# line); they stay attributable to that SHA in this repository's history.
OSS_REF=a832c8e9ef4f4246a034b2c5907c6a2f031685f2
